        "content": "Hi there! I'm Alex Thompson, a manager at Success LLC. I've really enjoyed using your CRM and I'm actually looking to refer a few of my colleagues to your service. Before I make those introductions, I'd love to understand a bit more about your referral program. Could you help me set up a referral opportunity named 'Success LLC Referral'? I know my account already exists in your system, so I just need to get that referral link or process started."
