        "content": "Got it. So, once my colleagues sign up through that referral, is there a specific reward or incentive for me as the referrer? Also, are there any restrictions on how many people I can refer or if there's a time limit on when they need to sign up for the referral to count? I want to make sure I'm setting my team up for success and that they'll have a smooth onboarding process."
